- Guide/scoreboard owns sample readiness and later class-specific promotion. A worker never declares its variant champion.

If the experiment is absent/inactive, the kind is unmapped, or no lawful assignment can be reconstructed, continue ordinary productive-chain behavior without inventing experiment metadata.

### POST-OWNERSHIP GROWTH POLICY / CONTEXT CAPSULE

