For Guide/opportunity work without a job source, compile the same capsule from the allocator-supplied mission/evidence and role protocols only.

The active value budget is a SOFT post-ownership preference. If fresh scoreboard `growth_health.control_overhead_budget_state=PRESSURE`, and the refreshed compact frontier offers an already-grounded compatible `PRODUCT_VALUE` candidate comparable in priority/safety to optional additional `SYSTEM_MULTIPLIER`/control work, prefer the product candidate. Critical rescue, safety, authority, capability and current definition-of-done always outrank this preference. Never create visible filler to satisfy a ratio.

For a portfolio/opportunity job, load job-specific protocols/context only.

For `GUIDE_ROLE_PIN_CREATE`, NOW load:
